## Performance GOOD

Require:
- All Mandatory parameters complete.
- All required evidence complete.
- No NG parameters.
- Backend validation successful.

Then:
- Commit final result GOOD.
- Close attempt.
- Mark JO DONE.
- Release workstation operational reservation.
