## Performance NOT GOOD

Require:
- All Mandatory parameters complete.
- At least one NG parameter.
- Required NG descriptions/evidence.

Then:
- Close attempt as NOT GOOD.
- Create MRI-B.
- Preserve all failed parameters and evidence.
- Enter Adjustment workflow.

## Performance Retest

Before Start Retest:
- Require one general corrective action remark per MRI-B.
- Do not require Supervisor approval.

At Start Retest:
- Create a new attempt.
- Use a fresh blank checksheet.
- Load latest published applicable checksheet version.
- Do not copy previous GOOD/NG values.
- Preserve all prior attempts.

Retest normally remains on the same workstation unless Supervisor performs a controlled transfer.

