Verify compatibility and configurable scoring.

### Test 8 — Supervisor Approval

Verify AI cannot allocate without Supervisor approval.

### Test 9 — Free Queue Selection

Operator starts a non-first approved JO.

### Test 10 — Concurrent Start

Two clients attempt to start the same JO.

Only one succeeds.

### Test 11 — Workstation Conflict

Prevent two active attempts on one workstation.

### Test 12 — Supervisor Abort

Abort active Performance Attempt.

Preserve partial history and duration.

No MRI-B.

